### POST Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Food"
}

### GET ALL Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories

### PUT Category
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Vehicles"
}

### DELETE Category
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/2

### POST Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Malteada Popsy",
  "description": "Juan Valdez Crack",
  "price": 10.0,
  "amount": 10,
  "status": "DISPONIBLE",
  "category": {
    "idCategory": 2,
    "categoryName": "Tech"
  }
}

### PUT Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "PS5",
  "description": "White",
  "price": 1300.99,
  "amount": 0,
  "status": "NO_DISPONIBLE",
  "category": {
    "idCategory": 2,
    "categoryName": "Tech"
  }
}

### GET Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### GET Products By Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/get-all-by-category/2

### DELETE Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/2

### GET By Stauts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/list-by-status/NO_DISPONIBLE

### GET Count
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/count-all
